  "$comment": "The vendors a seat can name (Stage 9). protocol: anthropic and openai are the native adapters; openai-compatible is the one adapter for every provider that speaks OpenAI's chat completions (base URL + key + model). key: the Settings key it needs, null for one that needs none (Ollama, on this computer). builders: the agent drivers of packages/workbench/src/builders that run on this vendor's models. models: the models House of Rama has used on that vendor, offered first; a seat may name any model the vendor serves, typed in Settings → Brains.",
